# Lenovo Legion Y720 keyboard backlight and its Fn+Space / numpad-7 keys.
# The hidraw node is the I2C device 048d:837a. Its parent HID device is named
# <bus>:048D:837A.<n> (e.g. 0018:048D:837A.0006) and has no id/vendor or
# id/product attributes, so match the name. The hotkey node is the USB
# keyboard named below, not the sibling "Wireless Radio Control" interface
# and not the AT keyboard.
#
# Group y720 contains only the system service account. People are not members.

KERNEL=="hidraw*", SUBSYSTEMS=="hid", KERNELS=="*:048D:837A.*", GROUP="y720", MODE="0660"
KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="ITE Tech. Inc. ITE Device(8910) Keyboard", GROUP="y720", MODE="0660"
